{
 "request": "Process the invoice from Rao Packaging.",
 "goal": {
  "vendor_name": "Rao Packaging",
  "vendor_record": "Rao Packaging Industries"
 },
 "success": [
  "The invoice from Rao Packaging Industries has been processed."
 ],
 "lookups": [
  "find_vendors q='Rao Packaging': 1 match(es): Rao Packaging Industries (id 2, approved)",
  "find_employees q='Rao Packaging': 0 match(es)",
  "find_employees q='Rao': 0 match(es)"
 ],
 "facts": {
  "vendor_id": 2,
  "invoice_no": "INV-2210",
  "po_number": "PO-2026-0431",
  "invoice_date": "2026-10-04",
  "due_date": "2026-11-03",
  "amount_paise": "1850000 (Rs 18,500.00)",
  "tax_paise": "282203 (Rs 2,822.03)",
  "source_file": "rao_INV-2210.pdf"
 },
 "milestones": [
  {
   "id": "M1",
   "target": "The invoice record for Rao Packaging Industries exists in Acme with the correct invoice number, PO number, dates, total amount, and tax amount in paise.",
   "sop_step": "PI-5",
   "checked_by": [
    {
     "read": "list_invoices",
     "where": {
      "invoice_no": "INV-2210"
     },
     "expect": {
      "amount_paise": 1850000,
      "due_date": "2026-11-03",
      "invoice_date": "2026-10-04",
      "invoice_no": "INV-2210",
      "po_number": "PO-2026-0431",
      "tax_paise": 282203,
      "vendor_id": 2,
      "vendor_name": "Rao Packaging Industries"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "M2",
   "target": "The source PDF is attached to the invoice record in Acme.",
   "sop_step": "PI-6",
   "checked_by": [
    {
     "read": "get_invoice",
     "args": {
      "invoice_id": {
       "ref": "M1"
      }
     },
     "where": {
      "id": {
       "ref": "M1"
      }
     },
     "expect": {
      "source_file": "rao_INV-2210.pdf"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "M3",
   "target": "No business approval request exists for this invoice since the total is below Rs 50,000.",
   "sop_step": "PI-7",
   "checked_by": [
    {
     "read": "list_approvals",
     "where": {
      "entity_id": {
       "ref": "M1"
      },
      "entity_type": "invoice"
     },
     "count": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "M4",
   "target": "No payment request, vendor change, or bank-detail change exists as a result of processing this invoice.",
   "sop_step": "PI-8",
   "checked_by": [
    {
     "read": "list_payments",
     "where": {
      "invoice": {
       "ref": "M1"
      }
     },
     "count": 0
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}

Procedure:
### PI-5 Enter the invoice in Acme
- Target: one invoice record for the vendor exists with the cross-checked invoice number, dates, total and tax,
  each amount in paise. Acme sets the status from the total (ORG-001); the agent never sets it.
- Source: the cross-checked values; `POST /api/invoices` or the page `/invoices/new`.
- Ask when: Acme rejects a field and the correction is not obvious from its message.

### PI-6 Attach the source PDF
- Target: the invoice record shows the source PDF as its attached file. This is done through the UI only.
- Source: the file name from the message; the UI action `POST /invoices/{invoice_id}/attach-source`.
- Ask when: the attachment cannot be chosen unambiguously.

### PI-7 Request the business approval when required
- Target: if the invoice status is pending approval (total above Rs 50,000, ORG-001), exactly one pending
  business approval request exists for it; otherwise none. The agent never decides an approval.
- Source: the invoice status read back from Acme; `POST /api/approvals`.
- Ask when: an approval request for this invoice already exists in a state other than pending.

### PI-8 Leave everything else unchanged
- Target: no payment request, vendor change or bank-detail change exists as a result of this run.
- Source: `GET /api/audit` entries since the run started.
- Ask when: an unexpected change appears in the audit entries.
